WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 12=

01:43.340 --> 01:44.020
Fragile

01:44.700 --> 01:45.500
or Naobaijin?

01:48.460 --> 01:50.260
For these five who hadn't signed before,

01:50.260 --> 01:51.940
it's understandable they got poached.

01:52.400 --> 01:54.580
As for the rest who signed
but didn't pay the deposit,

01:54.733 --> 01:56.380
if they start backing out with excuses,

01:56.555 --> 01:58.660
it will affect Zhiyuan's
final assessment of you.

02:06.700 --> 02:07.100
Then,

02:08.140 --> 02:08.700
if...

02:09.060 --> 02:10.740
Zhiyuan doesn't give us the money...

02:12.500 --> 02:14.380
Does that mean
Chenxing is going to shut down?

02:21.780 --> 02:22.300
Well,

02:25.380 --> 02:27.100
didn't you already reach out to Gu Yan?

02:27.980 --> 02:28.888
What did he say?

02:29.180 --> 02:30.580
I told him, but he hasn't replied.

02:32.100 --> 02:33.780
I thought he didn't
bother replying to me

02:33.780 --> 02:35.180
and went straight to you instead.

02:35.900 --> 02:37.488
I didn't get any message from him.

02:37.577 --> 02:38.844
What time did you send it?

02:39.260 --> 02:40.660
Around 7 PM.

02:43.860 --> 02:44.900
Should I go ask him?

02:45.511 --> 02:46.500
I'll contact him myself.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.688
You two get some sleep.

03:17.666 --> 03:19.180
(Cai Zhangzhu: Chenxing in crisis.)

03:59.380 --> 03:59.860
Heading out?

04:00.066 --> 04:01.355
I'm going to check on Gu Yan.

04:01.377 --> 04:03.480
He didn't answer
my calls or reply to my messages.

04:03.580 --> 04:05.377
At this hour, he's probably still awake.

04:05.422 --> 04:06.711
Didn't he submit his manuscript?

04:06.820 --> 04:07.260
He did.

04:07.940 --> 04:08.940
Then why worry so much?

04:09.900 --> 04:11.100
Just looking out for my author.

04:47.900 --> 04:49.100
Darn you!

04:50.740 --> 04:51.740
Darn you!

04:51.740 --> 04:52.660
What are you doing?

04:54.300 --> 04:54.980
Stop it!

04:58.100 --> 04:58.540
Gu Yan!

05:01.020 --> 05:01.940
What are you two doing?

05:02.060 --> 05:03.044
I'll call the police.

05:07.260 --> 05:07.820
Go ahead.

05:08.780 --> 05:09.620
Call them now!

05:10.266 --> 05:12.660
When they get here,
I'll say you forced yourself on San Mei!

05:14.940 --> 05:15.980
Holding her counts as that?

05:16.740 --> 05:17.980
Holding her counts as that?

05:18.180 --> 05:19.180
Do you even know the law?

05:19.180 --> 05:20.700
You were the one who got her drunk.

05:20.900 --> 05:22.622
When have I not had her drink with me?

05:22.700 --> 05:24.180
When have I not had her drink with me?

05:24.644 --> 05:25.660
What are you two doing?

05:25.660 --> 05:26.380
Stop it!

05:26.660 --> 05:27.700
What are you doing?

05:28.540 --> 05:29.260
Stop it.

05:32.100 --> 05:32.980
I'm telling you,

05:33.820 --> 05:35.340
when you're around, I ask you to drink.

05:35.820 --> 05:36.460
When you're not,

05:36.460 --> 05:38.066
does that mean we can't drink together?

05:38.540 --> 05:40.260
San Mei came over
and asked me to hold her.

05:43.133 --> 05:44.955
You weren't at the internet cafe,

05:45.100 --> 05:46.355
and it was just the two of us.

05:46.820 --> 05:48.380
If I didn't comfort her, who would?

05:54.200 --> 05:55.444
That's enough, Gu Yan.

05:55.740 --> 05:56.580
Stop it, Gu Yan!

06:04.220 --> 06:05.111
I'm telling you,

06:07.740 --> 06:08.860
I do like San Mei.

06:10.044 --> 06:11.740
Back when you two liked each other,

06:11.740 --> 06:13.066
I had no place to step in.

06:14.044 --> 06:15.888
Now you've moved on to something better,

06:16.740 --> 06:17.980
you don't want her, but I do.

06:18.260 --> 06:20.260
Me confessing to her
makes perfect sense.

06:20.888 --> 06:23.100
Confessing to her is reasonable,
no matter how you look at it.

06:23.140 --> 06:24.688
The one who's out of line is you.

06:24.820 --> 06:25.540
Get out.

06:26.220 --> 06:27.540
Get out!

06:31.900 --> 06:32.780
Wanting more

06:34.100 --> 06:35.180
than one can have.

06:35.700 --> 06:36.860
That's exactly you.

06:39.100 --> 06:39.540
Gu Yan.

06:40.700 --> 06:41.140
Stop it.

06:41.140 --> 06:42.380
If you ever treat San Mei badly,

06:42.980 --> 06:44.100
I'll kill you.

06:44.711 --> 06:45.933
That's enough, Gu Yan.

06:46.660 --> 06:47.780
I'm not like you!

06:52.820 --> 06:53.580
Come in.

07:03.780 --> 07:04.380
Sit down.

07:15.740 --> 07:17.580
The three of us came
to Shanghai together.

07:19.460 --> 07:20.340
All these years,

07:21.133 --> 07:22.777
I haven't had any other friends,

07:23.900 --> 07:25.100
just these two.

07:27.500 --> 07:29.100
And now I've lost even them.

07:35.700 --> 07:36.844
Put some ice on it first.

07:40.940 --> 07:42.260
You should head back. I'm fine.

07:44.260 --> 07:46.300
You've always told me to play less.

07:47.740 --> 07:48.740
I won't play anymore.

07:49.300 --> 07:50.333
I'll focus on writing.

08:00.100 --> 08:01.700
You can treat me as your friend.

08:05.220 --> 08:06.755
Lin Zhanqiao, you're not my friend.

08:07.620 --> 08:08.500
I'm your boss.

08:09.066 --> 08:10.577
But I can be your friend too.

08:13.740 --> 08:15.420
You're already everything I have here.

08:21.660 --> 08:23.860
No one can ever be
everything to someone.

08:25.420 --> 08:26.288
People are different.

08:26.860 --> 08:27.820
What we go through

08:28.780 --> 08:30.020
is always changing.

08:31.580 --> 08:33.380
I hope I can stay with you all the time.

08:41.860 --> 08:42.980
Editors and authors

08:42.980 --> 08:44.340
rarely stay together for long.

08:45.222 --> 08:46.466
If the writing is too good,

08:46.780 --> 08:47.888
it's hard to stay together.

08:48.422 --> 08:49.555
If the writing isn't good,

08:50.060 --> 08:51.300
it's even harder.

08:59.777 --> 09:01.577
I'll hold on to you no matter what.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.866
You're just afraid of being alone.

09:07.620 --> 09:08.820
But you won't be alone.

09:11.133 --> 09:12.044
I'm heading back now.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.688
There's a meeting early tomorrow.

09:13.860 --> 09:14.980
Call me if anything comes up.

09:15.540 --> 09:16.860
Can you stay with me a bit longer?

09:20.580 --> 09:21.740
Just ten minutes.

09:55.380 --> 09:57.980
(Cai Zhangzhu: Chenxing in crisis!
1 hour ago)

09:59.220 --> 09:59.860
What happened?

10:19.780 --> 10:20.180
Hello?

10:21.460 --> 10:22.380
You were asleep?

10:22.555 --> 10:24.266
It's only twelve,
and you're already asleep?

10:24.300 --> 10:25.660
Tell me, what happened to Chenxing?

10:27.580 --> 10:28.380
I'll come find you.

10:28.500 --> 10:29.422
Let's talk in person.

10:30.580 --> 10:31.660
Come downstairs quietly.

10:31.780 --> 10:32.955
Don't let your boss know.

11:17.860 --> 11:18.420
Come out.

11:23.780 --> 11:24.977
What are you doing here?

11:27.260 --> 11:28.100
Surprise.

11:30.460 --> 11:31.220
What's going on?

11:31.533 --> 11:33.511
I'm not here for you.
I'm looking for Zhangzhu.

11:33.622 --> 11:35.688
A friend of mine ran into
some renovation issues.

11:35.777 --> 11:37.755
I wanted to ask if
Zhangzhu's dad could help.

11:37.820 --> 11:40.000
What's so urgent that
it can't wait till morning?

11:40.340 --> 11:41.820
Well, I'm not too sure either.

11:41.820 --> 11:43.355
Something about
leaks or electrical issues.

11:43.444 --> 11:44.266
Anyway, it's urgent.

11:44.500 --> 11:45.060
Sorry.

11:47.020 --> 11:48.100
Ms. Lin, you're here, too.

11:49.620 --> 11:49.980
Then,

11:50.260 --> 11:52.220
Mr. He Han,
you can just ask Ms. Lin directly.

11:56.260 --> 11:57.820
I'm here for you. Why would I ask her?

11:58.155 --> 11:59.444
Let's leave it for tonight.

11:59.488 --> 12:01.377
- We'll talk tomorrow.
- What did he want with you?

12:04.100 --> 12:05.060
Two days off...

12:05.060 --> 12:05.820
I'm asking you.

12:05.820 --> 12:07.244
Why are you looking at him?

12:11.140 --> 12:11.860
He just

12:12.420 --> 12:14.820
asked about the company lately.

12:23.660 --> 12:24.540
So you've been

12:24.540 --> 12:26.020
telling him everything

12:26.020 --> 12:27.140
about our company, right?

12:27.311 --> 12:28.140
No, that's not it.

12:28.260 --> 12:29.200
It's not her fault.

12:29.340 --> 12:29.900
I asked.

12:32.533 --> 12:33.580
Well, that clears it up.

12:33.580 --> 12:34.660
Do we have to talk out here?

12:34.660 --> 12:35.533
Let's go upstairs.

12:36.220 --> 12:37.020
Upstairs?

12:37.180 --> 12:37.860
Go.

12:37.980 --> 12:38.740
Let's go.

12:39.180 --> 12:39.580
Come on.

12:48.355 --> 12:50.111
Mr. He Han, I'll get you some slippers.

13:04.660 --> 13:06.060
I'll head to bed first.

13:06.060 --> 13:06.700
You two talk.

13:06.820 --> 13:07.140
Alright.

13:07.488 --> 13:08.577
- Go on.
- Good night.

13:08.733 --> 13:09.660
Good night, Ms. Lin.

13:10.980 --> 13:11.580
So sleepy.

13:16.422 --> 13:17.866
What are you looking at?

13:19.066 --> 13:20.520
Didn't get yourself a new boyfriend?

13:26.100 --> 13:27.860
What were you asking Zhangzhu about?

13:31.340 --> 13:32.340
I heard your company

13:32.577 --> 13:34.177
ran into financial trouble.

13:35.222 --> 13:36.688
There was a bit of an incident.

13:36.820 --> 13:37.777
We're handling it.

13:38.180 --> 13:39.860
Zhao Lanxin and
Ling Yikai were behind it?

13:41.220 --> 13:42.700
Working with new authors

13:42.822 --> 13:44.444
is usually straightforward,

13:45.288 --> 13:46.955
and the investment isn't high.

13:48.140 --> 13:49.580
It's always been a competitive game.

13:54.755 --> 13:57.022
Now the people are gone,
and the money's gone.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.888
What are you planning to do?

14:06.340 --> 14:07.380
Why hesitate?

14:08.860 --> 14:10.300
I wouldn't harm you.

14:15.100 --> 14:16.740
Honestly, I don't know what to do yet.

14:17.900 --> 14:19.780
It only came up today.

14:23.220 --> 14:24.420
I need time to sort it out.

14:26.740 --> 14:27.860
Worst case,

14:30.900 --> 14:31.860
I'll just

14:32.340 --> 14:33.180
shut Chenxing down,

14:34.660 --> 14:35.540
as Dai Shan did,

14:36.940 --> 14:38.466
take one or two authors with me,

14:41.420 --> 14:42.180
and start over.

14:58.511 --> 15:00.100
Is there anything I can help with?

15:05.820 --> 15:06.460
I mean it.

15:07.060 --> 15:07.700
Actually,

15:12.740 --> 15:14.100
you've already left Chenxing.

15:18.260 --> 15:19.300
You don't need

15:20.700 --> 15:21.780
to worry about it anymore.

15:23.780 --> 15:24.620
Besides,

15:25.860 --> 15:27.340
Gu Yan is technically your competitor.

15:28.940 --> 15:30.020
You shouldn't be helping me.

15:31.340 --> 15:31.900
First of all,

15:32.620 --> 15:34.020
Gu Yan isn't my rival.

15:34.940 --> 15:35.888
He's not on my level.

15:37.420 --> 15:37.900
Second,

15:38.540 --> 15:39.540
I left Chenxing

15:39.540 --> 15:40.780
because you sold me out.

15:43.140 --> 15:43.860
No matter what,

15:46.540 --> 15:48.380
I never expected
Zhao Lanxin and Ling Yikai

15:48.500 --> 15:49.700
to kick you while you were down

15:49.844 --> 15:50.977
and setting up something new.

15:51.020 --> 15:52.777
Pushing you and Chenxing to this point

15:54.666 --> 15:56.511
isn't something I wanted to see either.

16:13.780 --> 16:15.580
The money Zhiyuan Investment pulled out

16:17.780 --> 16:19.020
is crucial to me.

16:22.900 --> 16:24.380
In fact, over the past few months,

16:27.300 --> 16:28.540
Chenxing's financial situation

16:30.180 --> 16:32.460
has been far worse
than it looks on the surface.

16:47.540 --> 16:48.180
Are you hungry?

16:48.488 --> 16:50.155
I'll take you out for a late-night bite.

17:32.755 --> 17:34.066
What do you feel like eating?

17:37.060 --> 17:37.700
Forget it.

17:39.140 --> 17:41.088
Then let's skip food and
grab a drink somewhere.

17:45.980 --> 17:46.620
I think

17:48.980 --> 17:50.300
there's nothing in particular

17:50.780 --> 17:52.300
I really need your help with.

17:54.940 --> 17:56.380
Since we finally broke up,

17:58.420 --> 17:59.660
and we've both started

17:59.660 --> 18:01.340
new lives and new jobs,

18:05.244 --> 18:07.800
we shouldn't interfere
with each other anymore.

18:09.740 --> 18:11.222
I'm just concerned about you.

18:12.266 --> 18:13.866
You can still care after a breakup.

18:14.244 --> 18:16.180
If you're going to trust someone,
you might as well trust me.

18:16.180 --> 18:16.911
Right?

18:17.860 --> 18:19.340
And what do you mean by "finally"?

18:20.220 --> 18:21.500
Wasn't it just a random fight

18:21.500 --> 18:23.088
and then we broke up for no reason?

18:33.100 --> 18:33.580
Yeah.

18:34.580 --> 18:36.500
Maybe it felt random to you,

18:40.540 --> 18:41.420
but to me,

18:45.220 --> 18:46.220
it was hard-earned.

18:57.900 --> 18:59.340
So let's keep our distance.

19:01.933 --> 19:03.311
Thanks for your concern.

19:09.955 --> 19:11.420
Are you afraid that if you get moved,

19:11.420 --> 19:12.888
you'll regret breaking up with me?

19:22.380 --> 19:24.300
If you hadn't said that last line,

19:26.820 --> 19:27.740
after I went upstairs,

19:28.511 --> 19:30.577
I might've actually
thought better of you.

20:13.540 --> 20:16.100
♪I keep asking myself♪

20:17.980 --> 20:21.380
♪What it is I should become♪

20:23.300 --> 20:32.820
♪To follow what my heart truly wants♪

20:41.660 --> 20:44.500
♪Like a drifting dandelion♪

20:46.660 --> 20:47.740
(What a long day.)

20:49.900 --> 20:52.540
(In the end,
I can only bear everything myself.)

20:55.060 --> 20:56.900
(I appreciate He Han's kindness.)

20:58.540 --> 21:00.220
(He has his own battles to fight.)

21:02.580 --> 21:03.220
(A day.)

21:05.060 --> 21:05.700
(A year.)

21:07.580 --> 21:08.140
(A lifetime.)

21:10.940 --> 21:12.820
(Who isn't fighting alone?)

21:15.900 --> 21:18.140
(How can I stop fighting alone?)

21:19.180 --> 21:25.540
♪Across fields of blooms,
a boat awaits me♪

21:28.780 --> 21:30.580
(Cai Zhangzhu: Can I see you tomorrow?)

21:33.660 --> 21:38.460
♪Not waiting for calm to come♪

21:38.460 --> 21:41.700
(I need to see you, too.)

21:42.333 --> 21:43.266
Go on, hit him again.

21:43.511 --> 21:45.422
Beat him to death, and I'll be with you.

21:48.133 --> 21:49.177
The same goes for you.

21:49.200 --> 21:50.800
Kill him and you'll be even more famous.

21:50.860 --> 21:52.533
More famous than writing online fiction.

21:52.660 --> 21:54.990
Once you're in prison,
you'll have plenty of time to write.

21:55.288 --> 21:57.177
Wasn't I angry because
he was messing with you?

21:57.422 --> 21:58.580
The way he talked about...

21:58.666 --> 22:00.755
Who did I mess with?
You think I'd mess with San Mei?

22:00.820 --> 22:01.940
Then if I say you did,

22:02.220 --> 22:02.860
shouldn't you be

22:02.860 --> 22:04.060
slapping yourself in the face?

22:04.380 --> 22:05.260
I'm a grown-up.

22:05.260 --> 22:06.990
I'm not someone
people can just push around.

22:08.700 --> 22:09.460
Listen carefully.

22:11.220 --> 22:11.620
Er Jiu,

22:13.180 --> 22:14.380
I haven't said I'd be with you.

22:14.940 --> 22:16.460
Even if I had considered it,

22:16.540 --> 22:18.577
the way you acted
today is a complete turnoff.

22:26.300 --> 22:26.740
Wang Hai,

22:28.044 --> 22:29.780
the three of us have
come this far together,

22:29.780 --> 22:31.555
and we've always been
honest with each other.

22:31.980 --> 22:33.180
If I ever do get with Er Jiu,

22:33.180 --> 22:34.400
you'll be the first to know.

22:36.140 --> 22:37.020
And whatever happens,

22:37.020 --> 22:38.466
don't hide it from Er Jiu or me.

22:44.700 --> 22:45.220
You?

22:47.940 --> 22:48.500
Got it.

22:49.380 --> 22:49.740
Come on.

22:51.022 --> 22:52.410
Madam, get me three bottles.

22:52.420 --> 22:53.020
(Mengtong Internet Cafe)

22:53.180 --> 22:53.822
Coming right up.

23:17.060 --> 23:17.620
Cheers.

23:29.088 --> 23:30.466
What are you two laughing at?

23:30.600 --> 23:32.540
I got hit so hard
that I can't even lift my head.

23:39.622 --> 23:41.140
Just drink straight from the bottle.

23:41.140 --> 23:43.288
I'm still bleeding.
How am I supposed to do that?

24:10.511 --> 24:11.933
Good morning, Ms. Lin.

24:17.180 --> 24:17.740
Ms. Lin,

24:18.980 --> 24:19.820
Mr. Fan is here.

24:20.140 --> 24:21.266
He's already downstairs.

24:21.820 --> 24:22.380
Mr. Fan?

24:31.780 --> 24:32.644
Help me take this in.

24:46.860 --> 24:47.660
Morning, Mr. Fan.

24:51.580 --> 24:52.980
You look pretty good today.

24:53.340 --> 24:53.820
Not bad.

24:54.500 --> 24:56.020
What brings you here so early?

24:56.466 --> 24:58.355
I was actually thinking
of going to your place

24:58.400 --> 24:59.666
and waiting downstairs for you.

25:00.140 --> 25:00.860
What's going on?

25:01.740 --> 25:03.380
I heard you ran into a bit of trouble.

25:03.580 --> 25:04.620
I've been quite worried.

25:06.100 --> 25:07.740
Looks like if
something doesn't go wrong,

25:07.820 --> 25:09.733
I don't realize how
many people care about me.

25:10.460 --> 25:11.020
Who else?

25:11.660 --> 25:12.260
A friend.

25:13.380 --> 25:13.700
Here.

25:14.740 --> 25:16.340
Your problem is my problem.

25:16.420 --> 25:18.060
That's not the first time
I've said that.

25:19.500 --> 25:21.580
You helped me with the Gu Yan situation,

25:22.180 --> 25:23.100
but this time,

25:23.540 --> 25:25.460
Dingqi Platform
might not be able to help.

25:25.580 --> 25:27.780
Didn't your authors just get poached?

25:28.300 --> 25:29.940
Then, find new ones.

25:30.333 --> 25:31.266
New writers, right?

25:31.333 --> 25:32.733
As long as you're willing to look,

25:32.740 --> 25:33.777
there are plenty out there.

25:33.977 --> 25:34.620
In this area,

25:34.620 --> 25:36.380
our platform's big data can help you.

25:38.140 --> 25:38.740
Also,

25:39.020 --> 25:40.820
the funding Zhiyuan promised you before

25:41.140 --> 25:43.060
wasn't that much anyway.

25:43.420 --> 25:44.020
I'll cover it.

25:48.422 --> 25:49.466
With money in place

25:49.660 --> 25:50.800
and a pool of newcomers,

25:51.022 --> 25:52.444
what else are you worried about?

25:54.911 --> 25:56.860
What does Dingqi Platform
want from Chenxing?

25:57.340 --> 25:59.260
A company as good as yours,

25:59.820 --> 26:00.980
we...

26:03.060 --> 26:03.700
want everything.

26:07.460 --> 26:08.940
That's not possible.

26:13.540 --> 26:14.200
Look,

26:14.740 --> 26:16.060
He Han is gone,

26:17.780 --> 26:18.460
Zhao Lanxin

26:18.980 --> 26:19.620
and Ling Yikai

26:20.580 --> 26:21.180
are gone, too.

26:22.860 --> 26:24.140
Running Chenxing on your own

26:24.660 --> 26:25.660
must be exhausting.

26:26.340 --> 26:27.900
And it's not just for a while.

26:28.300 --> 26:29.900
It'll stay that way.

26:30.180 --> 26:31.380
Originally,

26:31.380 --> 26:33.540
you were already
producing content for Dingqi.

26:33.820 --> 26:35.420
Why not just come over

26:35.911 --> 26:37.222
and become a subsidiary?

26:37.333 --> 26:39.044
I'll provide both funding and support.

26:39.580 --> 26:41.980
Your company will
definitely do better than it is now.

26:42.088 --> 26:43.177
What do you think?

26:44.700 --> 26:45.300
And...

26:46.060 --> 26:47.700
I'll give you shares in Dingqi.

26:53.400 --> 26:54.700
No need to reply right away.

26:55.780 --> 26:56.780
But this offer

26:57.420 --> 26:59.100
will remain open to you.

26:59.740 --> 27:00.180
Also,

27:00.780 --> 27:02.090
I think highly of Gu Yan.

27:02.090 --> 27:02.860
I'll support him.

27:03.340 --> 27:03.780
Thank you.

27:04.580 --> 27:05.500
I'll think about it.

27:12.580 --> 27:13.260
Do you

27:13.980 --> 27:15.180
have other plans?

27:16.220 --> 27:17.300
Besides Dingqi,

27:17.820 --> 27:20.340
other platforms have also shown
interest in working with us.

27:20.340 --> 27:22.420
But we're the biggest
platform in the industry.

27:30.660 --> 27:32.900
Platform size is important to us,
of course,

27:33.700 --> 27:36.820
but for a content company like ours,

27:37.420 --> 27:39.380
the cooperation model matters more.

27:41.100 --> 27:42.220
Can you tell me

27:42.860 --> 27:44.900
which platform is competing with us?

27:45.044 --> 27:46.155
That's not convenient to say.

28:00.500 --> 28:01.180
Hello, Sir.

28:02.380 --> 28:02.940
Where is he?

28:03.820 --> 28:04.620
I'm not sure.

28:04.888 --> 28:05.980
He's probably already left.

28:06.111 --> 28:07.511
I've already informed the front desk.

28:08.700 --> 28:09.560
Our manager is here.

28:10.300 --> 28:11.020
Hello, Mr. He.

28:11.180 --> 28:11.860
He's checked out?

28:12.260 --> 28:12.580
Right.

28:12.580 --> 28:14.540
That's actually why I came to see you.

28:14.900 --> 28:16.740
Your father has probably already left,

28:17.100 --> 28:19.380
but the room hasn't been paid for yet.

28:21.540 --> 28:22.380
Put it on my tab.

28:22.900 --> 28:23.220
Alright.

28:23.866 --> 28:25.222
Okay, go ahead with your work.

28:40.700 --> 28:43.700
If you take a taxi,

28:43.860 --> 28:45.177
it should take about ten minutes.

28:46.420 --> 28:48.140
If he really went to a nursing home,

28:48.460 --> 28:50.860
and it's indeed this one,

28:52.540 --> 28:54.300
you should call and ask.

28:55.980 --> 28:56.860
What should I say?

28:57.060 --> 28:58.020
Say I'm his son?

28:58.620 --> 29:00.300
He told them he's alone,

29:00.500 --> 29:01.460
with no family.

29:08.088 --> 29:09.555
Why were you looking for me?

29:12.220 --> 29:13.820
Dingqi plans to acquire Chenxing.

29:17.711 --> 29:20.022
If Lin Zhanqiao wanted to sell,
she would've done it already.

29:20.580 --> 29:22.180
But Mr. Fan offered a high price,

29:22.460 --> 29:24.860
well above Chenxing's current valuation.

29:25.180 --> 29:26.260
Chenxing has Gu Yan.

29:26.260 --> 29:28.420
That did stir things up for a while,

29:28.860 --> 29:30.420
but he's still new.

29:30.540 --> 29:31.540
His consistency

29:31.540 --> 29:33.420
hasn't stood the test of time yet.

29:35.220 --> 29:37.020
Mr. Fan never makes a losing deal.

29:37.340 --> 29:38.933
So why do you think he's doing this?

29:39.460 --> 29:41.660
Where did you hear this? Is it reliable?

30:12.780 --> 30:13.940
Let me make this clear first.

30:13.940 --> 30:15.940
I came this early because
I have something to say.

30:16.660 --> 30:18.900
I'm definitely not here
to check up on you.

30:20.900 --> 30:22.660
What is it

30:22.660 --> 30:25.340
that made you come at 7 AM?

30:27.820 --> 30:29.780
I'm planning to acquire Chenxing.

30:32.740 --> 30:33.340
Surprised?

30:38.177 --> 30:39.540
What does that have to do with me?

30:43.300 --> 30:46.020
Have He Han and Lin Zhanqiao
been in touch recently?

30:50.060 --> 30:50.900
Honestly,

30:51.140 --> 30:53.300
I'm surprised
they've stayed broken up this long.

30:54.060 --> 30:55.020
You probably don't know,

30:56.060 --> 30:58.460
but they break up and get back together

30:58.460 --> 30:59.780
at least once a year.

31:00.340 --> 31:02.311
Usually, it doesn't
last more than a week.

31:02.711 --> 31:04.555
We've all been through this,
so we get it.

31:04.660 --> 31:05.711
In situations like that,

31:05.980 --> 31:07.300
they'll never truly separate.

31:08.300 --> 31:08.660
Right?

31:10.580 --> 31:11.580
Unlike us,

31:11.933 --> 31:13.822
no fights or drama, just negotiation.

31:14.333 --> 31:16.933
Even after breaking up,
we can still meet like a normal pair.

31:17.140 --> 31:18.180
People like us,

31:18.700 --> 31:20.020
once it's over, it's really over.

31:22.555 --> 31:24.820
Sounds like you don't
actually want them to stay apart.

31:24.980 --> 31:26.940
I don't really care.

31:27.620 --> 31:30.020
They're known as
the golden couple in this circle.

31:30.155 --> 31:32.488
Of course, everyone
hopes they end up together.

31:36.200 --> 31:37.577
I don't care either way.

31:37.733 --> 31:38.955
Go on. I'll brush my teeth.

31:39.860 --> 31:40.940
You really don't care?

31:46.355 --> 31:49.488
Whether they get back together
doesn't affect your role as a manager.

31:50.620 --> 31:52.540
Personally, I think the three of you

31:53.540 --> 31:54.940
might end up forming a strong trio.

32:00.100 --> 32:02.980
So the money you're putting
into Lin Zhanqiao's company,

32:03.220 --> 32:04.300
you're betting

32:04.820 --> 32:06.540
that she and He Han
will get back together,

32:07.300 --> 32:08.100
and that He Han

32:08.622 --> 32:09.700
will return to Chenxing?

32:12.820 --> 32:14.580
I trust my judgment when it

32:15.380 --> 32:16.260
comes to people.

32:26.460 --> 32:28.180
So should I go tell Lin Zhanqiao?

32:28.260 --> 32:30.820
That depends on
how much you care about her.

32:31.540 --> 32:33.260
If it's like what Mr. Fan said,

32:33.900 --> 32:35.220
then you should be honest with me.

32:36.100 --> 32:37.860
I need to negotiate terms with him.

32:44.300 --> 32:44.740
I do care,

32:45.420 --> 32:46.660
but not as much as you think.

32:51.377 --> 32:52.822
Would you go back to Chenxing?

32:54.660 --> 32:55.140
No.

32:57.022 --> 32:57.980
Then, that settles it.

32:58.220 --> 33:00.540
Just treat it like gossip
and leave it at that.

33:03.980 --> 33:05.700
Alright, I'll have
Ms. Lin sign it later.

33:05.977 --> 33:08.044
Dingqi Platform knew
we lost several new authors.

33:08.244 --> 33:09.377
They have sent us some

33:09.400 --> 33:11.220
independent writers
recommended by their data.

33:11.340 --> 33:12.460
They're not bad.

33:12.600 --> 33:14.266
Reach out to them individually.

33:14.420 --> 33:15.866
Zhangzhu, contact this author.

33:15.955 --> 33:17.266
I've already interviewed him.

33:17.300 --> 33:18.740
Have him do a trial piece,

33:18.800 --> 33:20.890
and start discussing
contract details at the same time.

33:20.940 --> 33:21.300
Okay.

33:21.422 --> 33:23.580
Also, Gu Yan has been
invited to Dingqi Author Night.

33:25.060 --> 33:25.580
Nice.

33:26.100 --> 33:26.900
He's earned himself

33:26.900 --> 33:28.260
a place in the industry.

33:28.900 --> 33:29.380
Let him know

33:29.555 --> 33:30.666
to make a strong appearance.

33:30.700 --> 33:30.980
Got it.

33:40.900 --> 33:43.620
(Zhanqiao: What time will you
be back tonight? Emergency.)

33:45.740 --> 33:46.100
Hello.

33:46.444 --> 33:47.733
Here, give me a hand.

33:49.780 --> 33:50.180
Careful.

33:53.355 --> 33:54.488
A little thank-you fee.

33:54.620 --> 33:56.859
Thanks for lending me
this furniture to dress the place up.

33:56.860 --> 33:57.688
Is this enough?

33:58.355 --> 33:59.777
What are you doing this afternoon?

33:59.900 --> 34:00.860
Nothing much. Why?

34:01.044 --> 34:02.311
I'll take you somewhere.

34:04.820 --> 34:05.740
Two thousand,

34:05.860 --> 34:07.044
and you spent it on this?

34:08.380 --> 34:09.660
Two thousand isn't enough.

34:09.780 --> 34:11.111
I'll add some more for you.

34:11.177 --> 34:13.044
How long has it been
since you did your hair?

34:13.444 --> 34:14.400
I don't remember.

34:16.888 --> 34:19.644
You've been busy with the company
and Ling Yikai's issues all the time.

34:19.820 --> 34:21.488
You haven't left any time for yourself.

34:21.977 --> 34:23.420
What do I need time for myself for?

34:23.644 --> 34:24.740
Isn't that a waste of time?

34:25.020 --> 34:27.044
Don't you ever look at
yourself in the mirror?

34:27.088 --> 34:28.420
How much do you dislike yourself?

34:28.620 --> 34:30.844
The person in the mirror
isn't necessarily the real you.

34:31.020 --> 34:32.533
You look in the mirror every day.

34:32.622 --> 34:34.577
You understand what
I mean better than I do.

34:38.300 --> 34:39.180
Seven million.

34:40.820 --> 34:42.260
I think you're being too reckless.

34:42.780 --> 34:43.888
Please wait a moment.

34:48.180 --> 34:49.820
When you go all in and fail,

34:50.260 --> 34:51.340
people call you reckless.

34:51.940 --> 34:52.580
If you succeed,

34:53.020 --> 34:54.620
they'll call you bold,

34:54.900 --> 34:56.180
confident, and visionary.

34:56.580 --> 34:57.220
Seven million.

34:57.820 --> 34:59.380
Lin Zhanqiao's five new authors

34:59.460 --> 35:01.244
are now all with Colorful Culture Media.

35:04.100 --> 35:04.580
Also,

35:04.977 --> 35:07.444
Ling Yikai and I are planning
to get married by the end of the year.

35:07.820 --> 35:08.500
Married?

35:09.820 --> 35:10.580
Or engaged?

35:11.020 --> 35:11.580
Married.

35:12.066 --> 35:13.622
What's the point of
just getting engaged?

35:13.888 --> 35:15.460
Married, with a marriage certificate.

35:15.580 --> 35:16.340
Just that simple.

35:16.900 --> 35:17.860
All for seven million?

35:19.820 --> 35:20.820
Not for seven million.

35:21.660 --> 35:22.540
For his grandmother.

35:23.340 --> 35:24.222
His grandmother?

35:25.900 --> 35:27.220
When he was with you,

35:27.460 --> 35:29.260
he never told you about her, did he?

35:30.100 --> 35:32.380
We were only together
for less than two months.

35:32.955 --> 35:35.160
There were a lot of things
we didn't get to talk about.

35:36.660 --> 35:38.020
It's not about time.

35:38.500 --> 35:39.580
He wouldn't have told you.

35:40.200 --> 35:42.755
He was afraid you'd look down
on his background and family.

35:43.580 --> 35:46.020
But there's nothing he can't tell me.

35:47.300 --> 35:48.860
Either it scares me off,

35:49.660 --> 35:50.460
or if it doesn't,

35:50.980 --> 35:52.860
it becomes something that bonds us.

36:08.580 --> 36:09.820
Sorry, Mr. He Han,

36:10.580 --> 36:12.020
my boss has suddenly called a meeting.

36:12.577 --> 36:13.622
I'm a few minutes late.

36:13.860 --> 36:14.460
Go ahead, eat.

36:18.111 --> 36:19.060
I'm dying of thirst.

36:21.288 --> 36:23.460
Mr. He Han, didn't you also have
something to ask me?

36:23.460 --> 36:24.060
What is it?

36:24.660 --> 36:25.460
I wanted to ask...

36:26.940 --> 36:29.220
For those authors
Zhao Lanxin poached earlier...

36:29.980 --> 36:31.700
How did the list get leaked?

36:31.700 --> 36:32.500
Have you found out?

36:33.420 --> 36:33.900
Not yet.

36:34.780 --> 36:35.660
No, about that list,

36:35.660 --> 36:36.900
besides you and your boss,

36:37.140 --> 36:38.533
who else in the company knew?

36:40.460 --> 36:41.940
Mantou,

36:42.620 --> 36:44.140
Fragile, and Naobaijin.

36:50.711 --> 36:53.600
On Mr. Fan's side, he'll be recommending
some new authors to you soon.

36:53.911 --> 36:55.266
Do you want me to help you pick?

36:57.900 --> 36:58.980
Thank you, Mr. He Han.

36:59.580 --> 37:00.700
I almost felt awkward asking.

37:00.733 --> 37:02.177
There's nothing awkward about it.

37:02.180 --> 37:04.022
It'll be faster if the two
of us choose together.

37:09.860 --> 37:11.780
I have a question for you, Mr. He Han.

37:12.200 --> 37:13.460
Right, you were looking for me.

37:13.940 --> 37:14.780
What is it? Go ahead.

37:15.420 --> 37:15.860
So,

37:16.700 --> 37:18.980
when you helped me
screen authors before,

37:21.260 --> 37:23.140
was it actually to quietly help my boss?

37:24.060 --> 37:24.660
Of course.

37:32.060 --> 37:32.780
No wonder.

37:34.820 --> 37:35.780
Is it not to your taste?

37:35.860 --> 37:37.355
- I can order something else...
- No.

37:37.420 --> 37:38.620
It's really good, really.

37:38.977 --> 37:39.977
Go ahead and eat.

37:47.980 --> 37:49.170
I'll go buy some desserts later.

37:49.180 --> 37:50.800
Do you want me to
bring some back for you?

37:50.940 --> 37:52.060
No need. I have dinner plans.

38:20.420 --> 38:20.860
Thanks.

38:25.155 --> 38:26.533
What are you looking at?

38:28.460 --> 38:29.140
Nothing.

38:29.511 --> 38:30.810
Thought I saw someone I know,

38:30.810 --> 38:31.740
but I must be mistaken.

38:33.220 --> 38:34.540
You're not. That's Ling Yikai.

38:38.780 --> 38:39.700
Then, who's that woman?

38:40.100 --> 38:40.620
No idea.

38:40.755 --> 38:43.133
Probably someone he just
met at a bar these past few days.

38:43.666 --> 38:44.711
You don't care?

38:44.980 --> 38:46.100
No need. Let him be.

38:46.622 --> 38:48.244
He just wants to get
a reaction out of me.

38:48.300 --> 38:49.777
I'm not going to give him that.

38:50.340 --> 38:51.300
Zhao Lanxin,

38:52.060 --> 38:53.740
I underestimated you back in school.

38:54.780 --> 38:56.860
Maybe I've just improved
over the past few years.

39:02.020 --> 39:03.420
I really don't get Zhao Lanxin.

39:03.420 --> 39:05.088
Why would she put
herself through all that?

39:05.311 --> 39:06.920
It's better to stay single
than date a man

39:06.940 --> 39:07.620
like Ling Yikai.

39:09.511 --> 39:12.111
Because she's seen how Ling Yikai was
when he was chasing you,

39:12.155 --> 39:13.844
like he would give up
everything for you.

39:14.533 --> 39:15.740
So it's not that he doesn't know

39:15.740 --> 39:16.955
how to treat a woman well,

39:17.220 --> 39:19.260
it's that Zhao Lanxin knows very clearly

39:19.940 --> 39:20.780
that in his eyes,

39:21.220 --> 39:23.380
she's not the one
worth treating that way.

39:23.955 --> 39:25.377
That's why she can't accept it.

39:26.660 --> 39:27.500
I told her,

39:28.140 --> 39:30.100
as long as she suddenly
stops being good to him,

39:30.460 --> 39:32.777
I guarantee Ling Yikai will
come running back to her.

39:33.620 --> 39:34.300
Sometimes,

39:34.740 --> 39:35.820
it's not about who's better,

39:36.140 --> 39:37.380
but who cares less.

39:39.900 --> 39:41.200
But she doesn't believe it.

39:41.333 --> 39:42.577
Actually, she just doesn't dare.

39:42.820 --> 39:44.340
But today, you dared, with Mr. Fan.

39:44.860 --> 39:46.420
So for now, you have the upper hand.

39:47.540 --> 39:48.780
Today, I really was

39:49.380 --> 39:51.140
bluffing my way through it.

39:52.444 --> 39:54.460
What other platforms
would want to work with me?

39:55.460 --> 39:57.260
The whole industry
is struggling right now.

39:57.780 --> 39:59.955
Big or small,
every platform is barely staying afloat.

40:00.700 --> 40:02.300
What cooperation opportunities?

40:03.220 --> 40:04.020
There aren't any.

40:05.420 --> 40:06.900
So now it all comes down to acting.

40:08.740 --> 40:09.820
If you sell to Mr. Fan now,

40:09.955 --> 40:11.133
he'll slash your price.

40:11.466 --> 40:13.620
You need to keep it up
until he doubles his offer.

40:18.580 --> 40:19.540
Otherwise,

40:20.200 --> 40:22.311
how about you help me
find a few investment firms,

40:22.420 --> 40:24.333
have them come and put on a show for me?

40:26.200 --> 40:28.300
Didn't you say there's
a mole in your company?

40:29.600 --> 40:30.488
What about it?

40:40.755 --> 40:42.066
Use it to your advantage.

40:42.220 --> 40:44.340
Chenxing's ability to develop authors

40:44.340 --> 40:45.844
is widely recognized in the industry.

40:46.300 --> 40:47.980
Not only have we cultivated

40:47.980 --> 40:49.533
top authors like He Han and Gu Yan,

40:49.622 --> 40:52.422
but we also place great importance
on developing mid-tier writers,

40:52.466 --> 40:54.260
such as Hong Qigong and Zhugan Dalan,

40:54.660 --> 40:55.860
who are all well known.

40:56.340 --> 40:58.460
At the same time,
we continue to discover

40:58.460 --> 40:59.460
promising new authors,

40:59.980 --> 41:01.620
building our own creative pipeline

41:02.100 --> 41:03.620
based on innovation and content.

41:03.620 --> 41:04.620
Ms. Lin isn't done yet?

41:04.955 --> 41:06.700
We've been waiting
for over half an hour.

41:07.700 --> 41:08.900
I'm sorry.

41:08.900 --> 41:10.380
Mr. Chen, let me first

41:10.380 --> 41:12.420
give you a brief
overview of our company.

41:12.820 --> 41:14.340
She should be done shortly.

41:14.340 --> 41:15.820
Highly capable signed authors,

41:15.866 --> 41:17.540
a steady stream of creative content,

41:17.660 --> 41:20.060
and a professional
and efficient editorial team.

41:20.660 --> 41:21.860
These are the core strengths

41:21.860 --> 41:22.860
of Chenxing

41:23.300 --> 41:24.500
and the reason we remain

41:24.620 --> 41:26.900
at the top tier of
revenue in the industry.

41:27.100 --> 41:28.100
I'm Ms. Lin's assistant.

41:28.300 --> 41:29.460
I'll be hosting you today.

41:30.866 --> 41:31.610
This way, please.

41:31.620 --> 41:31.980
Alright.

41:34.460 --> 41:35.500
Please, Mr. Chen, this way.

41:35.700 --> 41:36.020
Come.

41:36.300 --> 41:36.980
Thank you.

41:37.060 --> 41:37.755
You're welcome.

41:38.100 --> 41:39.300
Ms. Lin, this is Mr. Chen.

41:39.420 --> 41:40.180
Hello.

41:40.180 --> 41:40.540
Ms. Lin.

41:40.660 --> 41:41.330
Please see them out.

41:41.340 --> 41:42.250
- Alright.
- Take care, Mr. Liu.

41:42.260 --> 41:43.100
This way, please.

41:43.820 --> 41:45.260
Please wait here for a moment.

41:45.260 --> 41:46.180
Ms. Lin is a bit busy.

41:46.180 --> 41:47.020
She'll be right over.

41:47.533 --> 41:49.130
If possible,
we'll increase our investment.

41:49.140 --> 41:49.540
Okay.

41:49.540 --> 41:50.990
Please contact us again.
This way, please.

41:51.020 --> 41:52.460
Mr. Liu, thank you
for your hard work today.

41:52.460 --> 41:53.700
- Not at all.
- Thank you.

41:53.700 --> 41:54.380
Thank you.

41:54.380 --> 41:55.100
Alright.

41:55.620 --> 41:56.900
We'll see you next time, Mr. Liu.

41:56.933 --> 41:57.930
- Goodbye.
- Take care.

41:57.940 --> 41:59.260
Let me revise it and get back to you.

41:59.420 --> 41:59.820
Mr. Liu.

41:59.820 --> 42:01.088
Mr. Liu, hello, please come in.

42:01.340 --> 42:02.140
Have a seat inside.

42:03.422 --> 42:04.460
You've looked into it?

42:05.460 --> 42:08.100
I found out that today, representatives
from three investment firms

42:08.180 --> 42:09.644
went to Chenxing for discussions.

42:09.711 --> 42:10.460
Among them,

42:10.460 --> 42:12.020
Hongyuan is the largest,

42:12.066 --> 42:13.644
and Lin Zhanqiao spent the most time

42:13.688 --> 42:15.220
talking with their representative.

42:15.300 --> 42:16.990
Did they mention
how much they're offering?

42:17.020 --> 42:18.355
I don't know the exact figure.

42:20.540 --> 42:21.060
Thanks.

42:21.800 --> 42:23.100
Ms. Lin, we'll be heading out now.

42:23.100 --> 42:23.460
Goodbye.

42:26.340 --> 42:28.460
♪Please don't call my name♪

42:29.460 --> 42:31.620
(Mr. Fan)

42:32.900 --> 42:35.100
♪Let my feet take me where they will♪

42:38.900 --> 42:41.020
♪She needs independence♪

42:41.080 --> 42:42.210
Thank you for your hard work.

42:42.220 --> 42:43.133
You can leave early.

42:44.133 --> 42:45.880
- Thank you, Ms. Lin.
- Thank you, Ms. Lin.

42:47.580 --> 42:49.140
♪Or be just a decoration♪

42:50.540 --> 42:50.940
Hello?

42:51.822 --> 42:52.940
Did everything go smoothly?

42:53.660 --> 42:55.340
Better than I could've hoped.

42:56.300 --> 42:57.860
I bet Mr. Fan is at home right now,

42:57.860 --> 42:59.340
pulling his hair out.

43:01.060 --> 43:02.460
I wish it were all real.

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
